Bundled data
- src/wellnizz_local/reference/variants_grch38.tsv: coordinates, alleles, gene
  symbols and protein changes taken from NCBI dbSNP (GRCh38.p14 placements, read
  2026-11-23). NCBI data is a work of the US Government and in the public domain.
  Educational notes in that file are by Wellnizz contributors and released under
  CC0-1.0.
- Synthetic sample data produced by `wellnizz-local synth` is released under CC0-1.0.
  It is generated from a seeded pseudo-random number generator and describes no
  real person.

LOINC
- The synthetic lab files use seven LOINC codes as identifiers. LOINC is
  copyright Regenstrief Institute, Inc. and the LOINC Committee and is available
  at no cost under the license at https://loinc.org/license/. No LOINC table or
  database is distributed with this project.
